  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n48 : 90\n\n46 : 51\n\n22 : 54\n\n42 : 68\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nRatio = numerator / denominator\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 48 : 90 = 48 / 90 = 0.5333\n\n⇒ 46 : 51 = 46 / 51 = 0.9019\n\n⇒ 22 : 54 = 22 / 54 = 0.4074\n\n⇒ 42 : 68 = 42 / 68 = 0.6176\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 46 : 51.**",
